## Re-syncing

```bash
VQ_SRC="/path/to/vq-react" bun run --cwd packages/vq sync
```

**A re-sync OVERWRITES `src/` in place.** Any local modification to a file under
`src/` is lost by that command. See `SYNC.md` for the current list of local
edits.

